the solution curves of the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{e^{- \\frac{x}{4}}}{8}?$" :question/worked-solution "Integrating the equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (\\frac{e^{- \\frac{x}{4}}}{8})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =\\frac{1}{8}\\int e^{- \\frac{x}{4}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}\\left(- 4 e^{- \\frac{x}{4}}\\right)+C \\\\ y & =- \\frac{e^{- \\frac{x}{4}}}{2}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now plot the solution curves by selecting different values for $C.$ The sketch below shows the solution curves for $C=-2,0,2.$\n\n![](images/25/258e0e2dea305737216c1a4cbc8f448d93055b1c97eb8b8e73805b7fb8425c73.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496432 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0229aff1-dd15-5dc0-8c29-4fe7230b6c3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/66/66c0cf6892e6d86094f6ce2cbebb03fde5b72b62142502eb7df37b189fe1e090.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496391} {:answer/id #uuid "25995fff-b334-5513-a18b-186af48cae46" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e7/e713f3dec38a143e0262ba7ebac0e654abf2bda07e5c9f05fdd0f98159a3af3d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496398} {:answer/id #uuid "2d1495df-de65-5c2a-808e-c395b77f25c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/3e/3e72325c08bf00f7ba5c76370b4be967249bb359cb4c8f106a5341192ec65be4.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496401} {:answer/id #uuid "51af2964-ab37-58f8-bfb2-3440d159b7cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/8f/8f7920be5fb2d5b085400b14ecaeaa9f48a1bfcd5574b26846d67d2d24998bac.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496410} {:answer/id #uuid "e47a143e-9a2a-504a-abb4-4687e24cbda0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d6/d6b9688cbe10695bcce92a75e8cb732370ff826697e340648e6b1e62114c61ca.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496431}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "25995fff-b334-5513-a18b-18